e":"dut","publisher":"Lev.","title":"Het obstakel is de weg","id":987201022,"publish_date":null,"cover_id":13126715}},{"ref":"d9","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":987101009,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987101009,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":987301007,"text":"Ryan Holiday gebruikt ideeën uit de stoïcijnse filosofie om naar tegenslag te kijken. Hij richt zich op het onderscheid tussen wat iemand kan beïnvloeden en wat buiten diens bereik ligt. Aan de hand van historische voorbeelden bespreekt hij manieren om met belemmeringen om te gaan zonder er volledig door te worden bepaald. Het boek presenteert obstakels als aanleiding voor een andere houding en gerichter handelen. Die benadering vormt een praktisch betoog, geen garantie op succes in iedere situatie.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://profilebooks.com/work/the-obstacle-is-the-way/","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p416948715"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T16:27:00.000Z","reference":"work:811","note":"Original publisher lists first ebook1May2014 and paperback2015. Proposed NL2018 edition is not the2024 expanded anniversary edition."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://profilebooks.com/work/the-obstacle-is-the-way/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL19977665W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p416948715"],"review":"content-review-017.json"},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":13126715,"sha256":"98645255b1130d65aa3d7b3f3005b870063dcb550717e0ab126179de28ee47b7","reference":"cover-semantic-review-002.json","limitation":"Front title/author and bound exact source edition; no visible barcode assertion."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T16:27:00.000Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-002"}},{"ref":"m9","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":"@e9"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@e9","work_id":987101009,"bound_author_id":987301007,"bound_title":"Het obstakel is de weg","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789400510159","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/13126715-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/13126715-M.jpg?default=false","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p416948715","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p416948715"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T16:27:00.000Z","reference":"work:811","note":"Original publisher lists first ebook1May2014 and paperback2015. Proposed NL2018 edition is not the2024 expanded anniversary edition."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://profilebooks.com/work/the-obstacle-is-the-way/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL19977665W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p416948715"],"review":"content-review-017.json"},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":13126715,"sha256":"98645255b1130d65aa3d7b3f3005b870063dcb550717e0ab126179de28ee47b7","reference":"cover-semantic-review-002.json","limitation":"Front title/author and bound exact source edition; no visible barcode assertion."}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T16:27:00.000Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-002"}},{"ref":"e10","relation":"editions","key":{"open_library_edition_id":"OL32419396M"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987101010,"open_library_edition_id":"OL32419396M","isbn_13":"9789024522989","isbn_10":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"Poema Pocket","title":"4 Seizoenen","id":987201023,"publish_date":null,"cover_id":13395080}},{"ref":"d10","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":987101010,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987101010,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":928300049,"text":"Vier novellen krijgen elk de sfeer van een seizoen mee. Ze volgen onder meer een gevangene, een scholier die een duister verleden ontdekt en een groep jongens die het bos intrekt. Een vierde vertelling wordt binnen een besloten kring doorgegeven. In uiteenlopende situaties raken de personages geconfronteerd met grenzen die hun gewone bestaan veranderen. De bundel legt de nadruk op menselijke verhoudingen en beslissende ervaringen, terwijl spanning en dreiging op verschillende manieren aanwezig blijven.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.stephenking.com/library/story_collection/different_seasons.html","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p137061226"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T16:27:00.000Z","reference":"work:300","note":"Complete Different seasons collection of four novellas. Keep collection Work; do not count its constituent stories as newly added Works."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://www.stephenking.com/library/story_collection/different_seasons.html","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL81621W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p137061226"],"review":"content-review-018.json"},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":13395080,"sha256":"476dbf3adb5a88a93c9645be13d5ec301b2d3d4c7260cd14e403837da32a6101","reference":"cover-semantic-review-002.json","limitation":"Front title/author and bound exact source edition; no visible barcode assertion."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T16:27:00.000Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-002"}},{"ref":"m10","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":"@e10"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@e10","work_id":987101010,"bound_author_id":928300049,"bound_title":"4 Seizoenen","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789024522989","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/13395080-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/13395080-M.jpg?default=false","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p137061226","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p137061226"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T16:27:00.000Z","reference":"work:300","note":"Complete Different seasons collection of four novellas. Keep collection Work; do not count its constituent stories as newly added Works."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://www.stephenking.com/library/story_collection/different_seasons.html","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL81621W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p137061226"],"review":"content-review-018.json"},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":13395080,"sha256":"476dbf3adb5a88a93c9645be13d5ec301b2d3d4c7260cd14e403837da32a6101","reference":"cover-semantic-review-002.json","limitation":"Front title/author and bound exact source edition; no visible barcode assertion."}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T16:27:00.000Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-002"}},{"ref":"e11","relation":"editions","key":{"open_library_edition_id":"OL31463073M"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987101011,"open_library_edition_id":"OL31463073M","isbn_13":"9789038890593","isbn_10":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"Nijgh & Van Ditmar","title":"Tirza","id":987201024,"publish_date":null,"cover_id":10522937}},{"ref":"d11","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":987101011,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987101011,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":8800017,"text":"Jörgen Hofmeester heeft veel van zijn zekerheden verloren. Zijn vrouw is weg, zijn werk biedt geen houvast meer en zijn geld is verdwenen. Hij richt zich des te sterker op zijn jongste dochter Tirza. Wanneer zij na haar eindexamen met haar vriend naar Namibië wil reizen, moet hij haar zelfstandigheid onder ogen zien. De roman volgt een vader die controle probeert te behouden terwijl zijn beeld van zichzelf en zijn gezin steeds verder onder druk komt te staan.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/nijgh-van-ditmar/boek/tirza/","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p307093182"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T16:27:00.000Z","reference":"work:1046","note":"Exact Dutch original novel Tirza2006. Anniversary publisher synopsis supports content but does not replace proposed2009ISBN/cover."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/nijgh-van-ditmar/boek/tirza/","https://www.arnongrunberg.com/words/1-netherlands-belgium/1-novels/112-tirza","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL850975W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p307093182"],"review":"content-review-018.json"},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":10522937,"sha256":"a592f3dc56fc0efca937da33937061e0a7e85cc50231f5975fd5398c56a3bae7","reference":"cover-semantic-review-002.json","limitation":"Front title/author and bound exact source edition; no visible barcode assertion."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T16:27:00.000Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-002"}},{"ref":"m11","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":"@e11"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@e11","work_id":987101011,"bound_author_id":8800017,"bound_title":"Tirza","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789038890593","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/10522937-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/10522937-M.jpg?default=false","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p307093182","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p307093182"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T16:27:00.000Z","reference":"work:1046","note":"Exact Dutch original novel Tirza2006. Anniversary publisher synopsis supports content but does not replace proposed2009ISBN/cover."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/nijgh-van-ditmar/boek/tirza/","https://www.arnongrunberg.com/words/1-netherlands-belgium/1-novels/112-tirza","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL850975W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p307093182"],"review":"content-review-018.json"},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":10522937,"sha256":"a592f3dc56fc0efca937da33937061e0a7e85cc50231f5975fd5398c56a3bae7","reference":"cover-semantic-review-002.json","limitation":"Front title/author and bound exact source edition; no visible barcode assertion."}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T16:27:00.000Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-002"}},{"ref":"e12","relation":"editions","key":{"open_library_edition_id":"OL42359473M"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987101012,"open_library_edition_id":"OL42359473M","isbn_13":"9789044359930","isbn_10":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"The House of Books","title":"De buitenstaander","id":987201025,"publish_date":null,"cover_id":13011890}},{"ref":"d12","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":987101012,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987101012,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":928300049,"text":"Na de moord op een jongen wijzen getuigen en sporen naar Terry Maitland, een bekende en gerespecteerde inwoner van de stad. Rechercheur Ralph Anderson laat hem publiekelijk arresteren. De zaak lijkt overtuigend, maar Maitland beschikt ook over een alibi dat zich niet gemakkelijk laat weerleggen. Het onderzoek komt daardoor voor twee schijnbaar onverenigbare werkelijkheden te staan. Anderson moet opnieuw bekijken wat het bewijs betekent en hoeveel zekerheid zijn eerste conclusie eigenlijk bood.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://open